ST on 2026-04-17: OpenClaw 2026.4.14 and skills up to date (1 global skill checked: simplemem-skill)\", \"Notion briefing at 08:00 KST on 2026-04-16: 79 items urgent (Security 14, Infra 33, Workplace 10, Daily 19). Priority items include: account cleanup, SDWAN extension, PIM config, ONEKORCRMDB902 timeout, OPEX 4+8LE audit, Netskope VM expansion, SQL auth IP blocking, SAP DR offshore compliance, SharePoint cutover, P1-P3 treatment ETA request, audit log deletion, PIM role init, Microsoft PIM owner expiry, Figma tool review, Teams quota usage, Flexera One port/permissions, Exchange domain verification, OT migration, OT contract renewal, Middle Kingdom Oracle regional/maintenance\", \"periodic-memory-maintenance: 3 consecutive errors (Telegram recipient @heartbeat could not be resolved, memory distillation automation disrupted, requires configuration update)\"],\n  \"notes\": \"Day rollover to 2026-04-17. GitHub backup push failure at 04:00 KST on 2026-04-17 (403 error, second consecutive failure, persistent). Security audit at 03:00 KST on 2026-04-17: 3 critical issues (improvement from 6). Morning briefing at 07:00 KST on 2026-04-16. Notion briefing at 08:00 KST on 2026-04-16 (79 items urgent). GitHub briefing at 09:01 KST on 2026-04-16 (10 repos: 5 trending, 5 all-time). Update check at 06:00 KST on 2026-04-17: up to date. Cron health: 8/8 healthy (daily-github-backup now shows lastStatus=error with consecutiveErrors=2). Total cards: 55 (Security 14, Infra 33, Workplace 10, Daily 8).\"\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776722420482}}
